<title>POLAND: Polish NBP buys dollars at PLN 3.1352 - dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP buys dollars at PLN 3.1352 - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) also bought dollars on the interbank market at 3.1352 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;large&quot;, came at 1050 GMT when the zloty was at 2.43 percent from the floating dollar parity rate for today -- the centre of the daily 14-percent trading band.</p>
<p>Earlier the NBP also bought dollars at 3.1345 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
